      ],
      "text": "3.1.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.20639038085938,
        511.34014892578125,
        115.62739562988281
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 22–26: HIV testing for people with presumptive and diagnosed TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.20639038085938,
        137.65260314941406,
        129.6273956298828
      ],
      "text": "their contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4356079101562,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Evidence from a review of studies that informed these recommendations found that offering HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4542236328125,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "testing, now referred to as “HIV testing services” (HTS) to people with presumptive and diagnosed TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4061889648438,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and their contacts yields a high number of new diagnoses of HIV  , also for those with presumptive  (10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4170532226562,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "TB who turn out not to have TB disease  . A systematic review of HIV prevalence among  (94, 95)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.41259765625,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "adults with signs and symptoms of TB, primarily among studies conducted in sub-Saharan Africa,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4114990234375,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "showed substantial variability in the yield of HIV testing, with a median HIV prevalence from 19.2%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.42236328125,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "(interquartile range: 8.3–40.4%) at the community level to 55.7% (interquartile range: 20.9–71.2%) at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4329223632812,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "primary care level and 80.7% (73.8–84.6%) among hospital inpatients  . Despite the low quality of  (96)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.3980712890625,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "evidence at the time of policy update in 2012, the GDG strongly recommended routine HIV testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4180297851562,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "and counselling to all people with presumptive and diagnosed TB as benefits of testing accrue to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        269.38238525390625,
        359.0354309082031,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "individual, their partner, the family and the community at large.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.442138671875,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "The two recommendations on the provision of HIV testing services to household or close contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4368286132812,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "of people with TB were based on a study in a concentrated HIV epidemic setting which showed a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3970947265625,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "relatively high yield of HIV testing in contacts of people with TB, with a higher HIV prevalence rate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4465942382812,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "(13.8%) among contacts of people with HIV-associated TB as compared with contacts of people who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4013671875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "had TB but not HIV (2.5%). Furthermore, there was a 74% acceptance rate of HIV testing among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        367.3824157714844,
        216.62591552734375,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with TB  .  (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4071655273438,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "HIV partner services is a process whereby a trained provider offers voluntary HTS to the partners",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4235229492188,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and contacts of consenting HIV-positive individuals. WHO recommends a range of feasible and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.3994140625,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "acceptable HIV partner service approaches to enable programmes to reach as many people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.43115234375,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "HIV as possible, which can be adapted according to setting, population, available resources and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.41796875,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "client preferences. Provider-assisted referral for HIV testing (also called assisted partner notification,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.41796875,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "index testing or family-based index case testing) is an effective method of delivering HIV partner",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.3850708007812,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "services to people with TB living with HIV and is an important strategy for extending HIV testing,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        493.3824157714844,
        475.33447265625,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "prevention and treatment services to their sexual partners and household members  . (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4431762695312,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The provider can contact partner(s) by telephone or email or in person and offer them home-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4257202148438,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "HIV testing services or invite them to visit a facility to receive HIV testing services. Assistance in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.42138671875,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "partner notification for sexual or drug-sharing partners, with shared disclosure and mutual support,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4191284179688,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "may also improve the uptake of and adherence to ART, benefiting both the index individual and their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        577.3823852539062,
        524.39453125,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "partners regardless of HIV status  . A strategic mix of facility-based, community-based, home- (97)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4553833007812,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "based and HIV self-testing options should be made available to ensure access to HIV testing services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        605.3823852539062,
        164.35960388183594,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "across these groups.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4203491210938,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "In all circumstances, HTS should be provided in accordance with WHO’s essential five Cs: consent,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.4190673828125,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "confidentiality, counselling, correct test results and connection or linkage to prevention, care and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4246826171875,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "treatment. Age-appropriate algorithms should be in place for undertaking HIV testing in young",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4026489257812,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "children, and HIV testing should be family- and child-focused. All people diagnosed with HIV should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4343872070312,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "be offered HIV prevention, diagnosis, treatment and care services, including ART. These services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        703.3823852539062,
        448.2532043457031,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "should be offered by TB programmes or through effective referral to HIV services.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "32",
